.TH 7ZIPLX 1 "2026-11-22" "7zipLX 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
7ziplx \- native Linux GUI for the 7-Zip archive engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B 7ziplx
.RI [ archive ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B 7ziplx
is a two-panel archive manager built with Qt 6. It uses the portable 7-Zip
engine for archive formats, compression, extraction, testing, hashing and
archive editing.
.PP
When
.I archive
is given, it is opened in the active panel after startup.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the application version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/7zipLX/7zipLX.conf
Persisted window, panel and tool settings.
.TP
.I /usr/share/7ziplx/translations
Optional compiled Qt translation catalogs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR 7z (1),
.BR 7zz (1)
.SH AUTHOR
7zipLX contributors.
